WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:20.917
Bird found a tree in the south.

2
00:00:20.918 --> 00:00:25.995
She hung up her bag.

3
00:00:25.996 --> 00:00:34.594
Then she started to build a nest.

4
00:00:34.595 --> 00:00:43.511
Soon a breeze blew through the tree.

5
00:00:43.512 --> 00:00:46.093
Bird's bag swung upside down.

6
00:00:46.094 --> 00:00:51.232
And Kip's lucky acorn fell out. Bonk!

7
00:00:51.233 --> 00:00:55.759
"Ouch!" said Bird. "Kip, please be careful with . . ."

8
00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:58.697
Bird looked up.

9
00:00:58.698 --> 00:01:06.584
"Silly me," she said. "Kip isn't here."

10
00:01:06.585 --> 00:01:09.714
Bird picked up Kip's lucky acorn.

11
00:01:09.715 --> 00:01:15.814
She started to feel a little sad.

12
00:01:15.815 --> 00:01:21.541
Kip was sad too.

13
00:01:21.542 --> 00:01:24.734
"I miss Bird," he said.

14
00:01:24.735 --> 00:01:33.688
"I'm not looking forward to winter anymore."

15
00:01:33.689 --> 00:01:37.849
Suddenly . . . Bonk!

16
00:01:37.850 --> 00:01:41.376
"My lucky acorn!" said Kip.

17
00:01:41.377 --> 00:01:46.637
He looked up.

18
00:01:46.638 --> 00:01:52.862
"Bird! You flew back!" he cried.

19
00:01:52.863 --> 00:01:56.497
"I thought birds flew south for the winter."

20
00:01:56.498 --> 00:01:59.650
"Other birds do that," said Bird.

21
00:01:59.651 --> 00:02:02.586
"I would rather stay right here."

22
00:02:02.587 --> 00:02:05.825
"With your friend," said Kip.

23
00:02:05.826 --> 00:02:09.682
"No," said Bird.

24
00:02:09.683 --> 00:02:21.469
"With my best friend."
